<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <title>Sensitive info Demo</title>
</head>

<body>
    <h1>Demonstracija nepravilne pohrane osjetljivih podataka</h1>

    <p>Unesite potrebne podatke za kreiranje novog korisnika i odaberite želite li uključiti ranjivost.</p>
    <p>Ovisno o odabiru, lozinka će se pohraniti u običnom tekstualnom obliku (plaintext) ili će prije pohrane biti
        hashirana.</p>

    <h2>Registriraj korisnika</h2>

    <form action="/ranjivosti/sensitive-info/add" method="POST">
        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required />

        <label for="password">Lozinka</label>
        <input type="password" id="password" name="password" required />

        <div class="vuln-toggle">
            <strong>
                <label for="hash-toggle">Uključi ranjivost</label>
            </strong>
            <input type="checkbox" id="hash-toggle" name="vulnerable" value="true">
        </div>

        <button type="submit">Kreiraj</button>
    </form>

    <h2>Popis korisnika</h2>


    <% if (users.length===0){ %>
        <p> Trenutno nema postojećih korisnika</p>
        <% } else { %>
            <table cellpadding="8">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Email</th>
                        <th>Lozinka</th>
                        <th>Kreiran</th>
                        <th>Upravljaj</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <% users.forEach(user=> { %>
                        <tr>
                            <td>
                                <%= user.email %>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <%= user.password %>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <%= new Date(user.created_at).toLocaleString("hr-HR") %>
                            </td>
                            <td>
                                <form action="/ranjivosti/sensitive-info/<%= user.user_id %>/delete" method="POST">
                                    <button type="submit" class="del-btn">Izbriši</button>
                                </form>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                        <% }) %>
                </tbody>
            </table>
            <% } %>


                <a href="/" class="btn">Početna stranica</a>

</body>

</html>